0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,10,10,10,1Style: Title,Agency FB,63,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,120,100,1,0,1,2,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP11 Lyrics,FOT-Greco Std B,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.6,0,2,10,10,15,1Style: OP11 Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,34,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:08.11,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,It's all right! Now let's move forwardDialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:11.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,with the sun always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:15.03,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,As power passes through our clasped handsDialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:18.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's grab hold of our wishesDialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:31.85,OP11 Credits,,50,0,230,,Translation  FUNimationDialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:32.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Working together, let's ride the giant wavesDialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,450,0,280,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,0,460,350,,Infoboxes/Title Card  BernieCraneDialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:40.33,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,Let's hurry toward the excitement-- there's the starting signalDialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:41.03,OP11 Credits,,0,100,420,,Editing FeesoDialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:47.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to set sail-- let's raise anchorDialogue: 0,0:00:42.51,0:00:47.12,OP11 Credits,,470,0,300,,Quality Checking  Alasta Galaxy 9000 Mr. LuffyDialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:55.00,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,Cut through the rainbow-colored wind and head for a sea of adventureDialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:58.57,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,It'll be a journey fraught with injuryDialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:01:02.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,but what you cherish most will be right thereDialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.47,OP11 Credits,,0,30,410,,Timing DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,And if you get into a jamDialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:08.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'll always be there to protect youDialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:13.36,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,It's all right! Now let's move forwardDialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,with the sun always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:01:17.23,0:01:20.35,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,If a storm hits, let's put our arms around each otherDialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:24.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,and gaze at the light beyondDialogue: 0,0:01:24.72,0:01:27.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,If we gather up the pieces of our dreamsDialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,they'll make a map leading to tomorrowDialogue: 0,0:01:31.73,0:01:34.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So let's grab hold of our wishesDialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:40.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,under the same flag-- together, we're oneDialogue: 0,0:01:50.47,0:01:56.00,Title,,0,0,420,,CombatDialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:02:00.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It goes in! Goal! Goal! Goal!Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:05.71,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Zoro! Sanji! You're awesome!Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:08.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You bums actually did it!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You did it!Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:15.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Aww! But I don't wanna give Choppy back!Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:18.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Sanji! Way to go!Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.13,0:02:21.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! They're awesome!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Bravo! Bravo!Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.91,0:02:26.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm totally moved to tears!Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.99,0:02:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys really are the best!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:33.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You dimwits! Who the heck praises their enemy?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:39.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this! No one defeats the Groggy Monsters...!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:44.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh hi Ref. Wakey-wakey.Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.97,0:02:48.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and blow the whistle! Go on!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:50.31,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Oh right.Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.61,0:02:53.55,Main,,0,0,0,,His behavior toward me was a flagrant foul!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,He's outta the game!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:03.05,Main,,0,0,0,,And there's the final whistle!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.21,0:03:05.91,Main,,0,0,0,,The Groggy Ring match is over!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.09,0:03:07.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your hard work!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.35,0:03:17.53,Main,,0,0,0,,In Round #2 of the Davy Back Fight,Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Team Straw Hat has unbelievably snatched victory awayDialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:26.75,Main,,0,0,0,,from the previously undefeated Groggy Monsters!Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:36.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course we won! Zoro and Sanji would never lose!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:39.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! Robin-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.47,0:03:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?! Did you fall for me?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:43.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You were wonderful!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:46.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You jerks! Don't scare me like that!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:48.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That hurts.Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:51.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You did great! You did just what I said!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.41,0:03:53.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You didn't do a thing.Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:59.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that Team Straw Hat has won Round #2's Groggy Ring game,Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:03.07,Main,,0,0,0,,they're allowed to swipe either a member of the Foxy Pirates' crewDialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:05.85,Main,,0,0,0,,or the Foxy Pirates' symbol!Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.07,0:04:10.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Who does the Straw Hat captain want?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:17.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:20.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Is it me...?Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:24.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They wanted me from the very start...!Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:28.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh man... I'm not ready to go yet...Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:32.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Crap it must be me! Our eyes just met...!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:36.35,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I bet it'll be me...Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:37.96,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Could be me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.35,0:04:41.59,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If he chooses me, I'll say goodbye to these guys with a smile...Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:45.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They like me, I just know it...Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:47.31,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Come on Luffy... Hurry...Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! I choose-Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:53.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Nami?Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:56.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Their boss will probably take part in the next round, right?Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:05:02.06,Main,,0,0,0,,If we take Chopper back now but lose in this next roundDialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:04.18,Main,,0,0,0,,they could just steal him again!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.94,0:05:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,In which case taking their boss nowDialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,is the best way to get Chopper back and keep him.Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:17.78,Main,,0,0,0,,U-U-Unbelievable! Is he going to call for the Foxy Pirates' captain?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:20.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That's the Peanut Strategy!Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:22.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are the lowest!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You lousy Peanutters!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:27.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Fight us fair and square!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:30.52,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no rule against itDialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,but suddenly calling out an opponent's leader after the second roundDialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,is an obvious attempt at avoiding a fair-and-square head-on match!Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:44.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe my ears! This is the devilish idea of an inhuman woman!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:48.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Her name is Nami the heathen navigator!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:52.31,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you insult Nami-san?! I oughta filet you!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:06:07.18,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Peanuts! Peanuts! Peanuts!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:55.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I hate them...Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:57.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if it doesn't go against the rules,Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,it seems it would go against pirate ethics.Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:02.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm with Nami on this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:06.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Their reaction's only natural. You're in the wrong, Nami.Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you shut up already?! Quit actin' cocky!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:12.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Our apologies!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:17.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, like it or not, Monkey D. Luffy, captain of the winning teamDialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:21.98,Main,,0,0,0,,gets to decide how this game will unfold!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:25.58,Main,,0,0,0,,He's free to choose anyone he wants from Team Foxy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:27.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He'll choose me I just know it...Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:31.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's obvious I'm the only choice here...Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:34.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna choose me? These guys are cool!Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, Navigator.Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:40.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Your proposal does give us an overwhelming advantage,Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:43.45,Main,,0,0,0,,but that also makes their boss part of our crew.Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:45.90,Main,,0,0,0,,No thanks.Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:52.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that Team Straw Hat's harassment of our boss has ended,Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,it's time to pick someone!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:57.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Who will he choose?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:04.28,Main,,0,0,0,,All right then. I wanna take back...Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Come back!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:11.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Choppy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:15.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you! I'm so happy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.34,0:07:19.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't cry! You know we'd never lose!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Our boss has sunk into the ground from the weight of his feelings!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:30.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they all rejected our boss like that!Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:34.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Boss! It's okay! We need you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We do, Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:37.92,Main,,0,0,0,,G-Guys...Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's teach these guys a lesson!Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:42.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I can't wait for the next round!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We love you, Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:47.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys...Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:52.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! You are my only true comrades!Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:53.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:07:55.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap will ya?Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:08:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I suggest you all ready yourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:04.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! I'd never lose to you in a fight!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:08.90,Main,,0,0,0,,How many times must I repeat myself?Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:12.88,Main,,0,0,0,,A fight and a game are two different things...Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:20.12,Main,,0,0,0,,At last it's time for the final combat round!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:22.34,Main,,0,0,0,,First order of business: establishing the battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:26.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The two competitors spin the cannon!Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:27.12,Main,,0,0,0,,And then...Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:30.16,Main,,0,0,0,,...wherever it stops will be where--!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:34.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on! That was clearly not normal!Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:38.92,Main,,0,0,0,,The battlefield has been set!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:43.30,Main,,0,0,0,,By sheer coincidence it's on the deck of our own Sexy Foxy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Coincidence my butt! You idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll now explain the rules of combat!Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:54.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything within 50 meters of where the cannonball landed is part of the battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:58.34,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's a 100-meter-wide circle!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:02.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Weapons are allowed as well as anything else within the circle!Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Only the two competitors are allowed inside the circle!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:09.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Knock your opponent out of the circle and you win! That's it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:13.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Note that the air and water inside the circle still counts as in-bounds!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.86,Main,,0,0,0,,F! O! X! Y!Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:18.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Foxy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The Flower Cheerleaders are currently on the stage performing cheers for our boss,Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:28.62,Main,,0,0,0,,while an opening fight is being held aboard the Foxy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:34.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Additionally, the Association of Stalls is selling limited-edition Davy Back Fight merchandiseDialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:35.82,Main,,0,0,0,,so be sure to check them out!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't need any of this! Just get started!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:43.38,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: "Foxy Pins"Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,...please!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:41.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Limited-edition Foxy pins!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:43.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't buy their junk!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Where's the participant...?Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:48.18,Main,,0,0,0,,There! Just take him already!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Why does popcorn and a cola cost so much?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:53.06,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, don't buy it.Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:54.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Lower it 80%!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:55.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Get outta my face!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:58.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The boundaries are in place!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:01.26,Main,,0,0,0,,This ends the opening entertainment! Thank you for your patience!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:04.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Now for today's main event...Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:09.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Combat! The bell will ring shortly!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry to the spectator stands everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:18.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What's happening?Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The sky is turning dark...Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This time we're being treated to a captain-versus-captain battle!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,First, in the left figurehead corner...!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:37.36,Main,,0,0,0,,A man who takes on all challengers and boasts a legendary undefeated recordDialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,of 920 wins and 0 losses!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:44.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Our boss Silver Fox Foxy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:49.36,Main,,0,0,0,,All right...Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:54.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up Luffy. You ain't your old self no more.Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.26,0:10:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,That hairstyle arouses a man's true wildness.Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:03.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Some ask if the champion makes the afro or if the afro makes the champion...Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Not even modern science can explain it.Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.74,0:11:12.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy... With an afro on, your punches will have some serious firepower.Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.66,0:11:14.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:16.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Did he wimp out on us?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:20.96,Main,,0,0,0,,And in the right corner hailing from East Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:27.74,Main,,0,0,0,,The leader of a miniscule pirate band with a 100 million-Berry bounty...Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:33.54,Main,,0,0,0,,..."Straw Hat" Monkey D. Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:41.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! The afroed Luffy is all fired up in the right corner!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:44.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Lookin' sharp Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:46.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy looks so cool!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:50.69,Main,,0,0,0,,He certainly does.Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:54.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Both fighters have stepped onto the battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:12:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Can Straw Hat successfully knock our boss out of the circle and protect his crew and pride?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Or will our boss's legendary undefeated streak strip him of everything he has?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:11.53,Main,,0,0,0,,This final and fateful combat round of the Davy Back Fight is about to begin!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:17.99,Main,,0,0,0,,What is all this?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.59,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the dressing room.Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a gloved fight, so choose anything you like.Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:25.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Awesome!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow this is more like a costume room than a dressing room...Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.99,0:12:34.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at all this stuff! And I can use anything I want Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:41.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey how about this? Does it look good?Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:46.09,Main,,0,0,0,,No... This is it...Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey Straw Hat! Nice fashion!Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:13:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Your butt is as good as kicked!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.15,0:13:04.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep your arms tucked in and show 'im your golden right punch!Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:08.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! His brotherly soul is burning red-hot!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:12.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Letting Usopp be his corner man was a mistake.Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish he'd take this seriously...Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:18.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't act so confident if I were you, Champion!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:21.41,Main,,0,0,0,,He's liable to bite your head off! Better watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.53,0:13:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, corner man! You're in the way! Scram!Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:27.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! My job as corner man is over already?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:28.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Corner man out!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:32.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Get goin' already!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.13,0:13:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:36.53,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no need for me to remain here either! I'll leave as well!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What? The stands are...!Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:47.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh cool! I didn't know they did that!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:54.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Now then, Straw Hat Luffy. Let's have some fun!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:59.87,Main,,0,0,0,,This entire ship is our battlefield! Rampage to your heart's desire!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:04.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We have plenty of skilled shipwrights, you see!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.77,0:14:12.23,Main,,0,0,0,,By sheer luck this bout is taking place aboard the Sexy Foxy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:15.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of deadly struggle is about to unfold?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:19.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The two pirates are now all alone inside the spacious battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:23.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep your undefeated streak going!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Win, Luffy! You hafta win!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.43,0:14:28.71,Main,,0,0,0,,His beam! Watch out for his beam!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:32.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Excitement fills the stands!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:34.15,Main,,0,0,0,,It's plunder or be plundered!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:36.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's one match only with no time limit!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:40.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Silver Fox Foxy versus Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:43.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a head-to-head battle between these two pirate powerhouses!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:46.03,Main,,0,0,0,,The fate of everything hangs in the balance!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.47,0:14:47.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Here comes...Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:51.63,Main,,0,0,0,,...the starting bell!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:53.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:53.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum... Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow Beam!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:05.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Only my fist is slow!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:09.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not so tough! You're all show!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.47,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:13.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Come back!Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:19.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow...Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:22.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Wha...?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:25.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow Beam!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:35.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He's floating! He's slow even when falling?Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:39.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I told him to watch out for that!Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:44.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Aww... Crap...Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.81,0:15:50.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter Straw Hat? Ready to throw in the towel already?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,...what...?Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:59.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Nine-Tails Rush!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:05.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Our boss unleashes a fierce attack right off the bat!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:07.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is helpless to do anything!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? He isn't even budging...Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:14.51,Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:16.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The effects are slow too that's all!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:29.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That was just a little "hello."Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.35,0:16:32.19,Main,,0,0,0,,The punches themselves didn't hurt you too much.Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:34.78,Main,,0,0,0,,That much is obvious to me, rubber man!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Darn... it...Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:40.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, your thirty seconds are about up!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.85,0:16:42.97,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hitting him all at once!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! He's going overboard!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:46.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:58.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Crap! The Slow-Slow Beam is more dangerous than I thought!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Beams sure are nice...Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:04.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Guess I shouldn't stretch more than I need to...Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:07.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Where'd that jerk go?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! I won't get hit by that anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:17.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Come out, Split-Head!Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:20.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't take your anger out on the ears!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.45,0:17:27.37,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Another Slow-Slow?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:33.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my ship!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.65,0:17:34.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Why you...!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.81,0:17:37.23,Main,,0,0,0,,He got me!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.53,0:17:41.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down, will you?Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:44.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to show you some hospitality here...Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Those cannonballs have been Slow-Slow-ed...Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:51.07,Main,,0,0,0,,If you can ride one then I can too!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.29,0:17:53.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh...! I wouldn't ride that one if I were you...Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:57.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, or that one.Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:05.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Told you so!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:13.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Darn it...Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:18.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Man he's wrecking his own ship...Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.01,0:18:21.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow Foxy Face Bombs!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Freaky!Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.43,0:18:35.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Pin badges? They're bigger than the one I bought!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:38.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course we are! We're bombs!Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:40.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You are?! Yikes!Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:43.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? A bomb just talked!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:46.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm... the real deal!Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:50.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:53.31,Main,,0,0,0,,...but I upgraded my gloves!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.53,0:18:56.51,Main,,0,0,0,,And the Face Bombs' 30 seconds are just about up!Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.73,0:19:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! Luffy! The body! The body!Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:04.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:07.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's happening with the fight?Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Dunno. Beats me.Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.81,0:19:10.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:28.91,Main,,0,0,0,,E-Explosions suddenly rock our ship...Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:32.35,Main,,0,0,0,,...which just happens to be the battlefield...Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:36.35,Main,,0,0,0,,caused by Foxy Face Bombs that also happened to be loaded...!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.81,0:19:41.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Making their ship the battlefield is such a dirty trick!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:44.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luffy! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.33,0:19:44.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Simmer down!Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:50.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Using this to his advantage, our boss succeeded in blowing up Straw Hat Luffy with a cannon attack!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:55.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it all over for him?! He's nowhere to be seen!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.35,0:19:58.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Whew, that was close!Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:00.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it was a--!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:04.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit it! You're annoying!Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.59,0:20:11.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is... alive!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.49,0:20:13.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You serious?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:14.91,Main,,0,0,0,,He's mind-boggling!Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.91,0:20:18.91,Main,,0,0,0,,He somehow evaded the close-range cannon barrage!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:24.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What speed! I-Is this the true power of a man worth 100 million?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:27.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course it is!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.21,0:20:27.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Just finish 'im already!Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:47.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! But it looks like our boss's next attack is already underway!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:56.99,Main,,0,0,0,,From out of the resulting smoke screen comes our boss's disturbing laughter!Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:20:59.15,Main,,0,0,0,,But where exactly is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What does "Silver Fox" Foxy have up his sleeve this time?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:15.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I hope you're ready!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.91,0:21:18.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You got blown up?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:21.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I did not! Don't be stupid!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Liar!Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:26.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't assume for one minute you'll leave this battlefield alive!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:27.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow Beam--!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:28.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Eh?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:29.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Gum Hook!Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.65,0:21:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,No more beams for you! I'm gonna smash your arms!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.95,0:21:37.57,Main,,0,0,0,,He disappeared into the smoke again!Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:41.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! There you are!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:45.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What? A board?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow Beam!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.85,0:22:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Now then! Which one is me? Where will the beam come from?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:08.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Darn it! How should I know?! They all look like stupid-heads!Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.47,0:22:12.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Stupid-heads...Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.29,0:22:16.32,Main,,0,0,0,,There!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.11,0:22:26.03,Main,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a warm-hearted individual?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.41,0:22:28.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You're in for it now! Look up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.55,0:22:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:37.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Crap! A trap door!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.59,0:22:39.57,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for being distracted!Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.15,0:22:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the one who told me to look up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.45,0:22:46.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You might wanna pay more attention!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.37,0:22:47.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.25,0:22:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...?! Whoa! The floor's moving!Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.25,0:22:52.01,Main,,0,0,0,,It's dragging me away!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.67,0:22:56.59,Main,,0,0,0,,There's Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:58.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Why'd he come out of there?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.47,0:23:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! He'll lose if he falls into the water!Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.45,0:23:04.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna fall in...!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:08.45,Main,,0,0,0,,So close!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.77,0:23:13.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Nah it'd be no fun if it ended so soon!Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.63,0:23:15.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Geez! What's with this ship?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.55,0:23:22.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go, fox?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.45,0:23:26.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.77,0:23:31.37,Main,,0,0,0,,A Foxy pin eerily taunts Straw Hat Luffy after his narrow escape!Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.91,0:23:34.49,Main,,0,0,0,,In there!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:38.01,Main,,0,0,0,,The inside of the ship is our boss's playground! Will Luffy be lured in?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.23,0:23:40.39,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Luffy! It's totally a trap!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.49,0:23:42.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He obviously has a bunch of booby traps set!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.07,0:23:47.89,Main,,0,0,0,,That jerk! I'm gonna beat his brains out!Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy rushes right in!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.47,0:23:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,The battle has moved inside but I can't enter to give the play-by-play!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.83,0:23:59.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the true essence of this round: a solitary battle between two combatants!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.67,0:24:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Get up! Get up Luffy! Remember your painful training!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.89,0:24:06.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit playin' around and sit down. I can't see.Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.47,0:24:08.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, a gun deck!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.45,0:24:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Man, it's big! I bet Usopp would love this!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.41,0:24:15.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, where is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.23,0:24:18.31,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.85,0:24:26.86,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! He's coming after me...!Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.95,0:24:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Now he'll bust through the door at breakneck speed!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.13,0:24:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Little does he know...Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.85,0:24:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,...that this room is filled with spikes!Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.23,0:24:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, rush in and get--Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.45,0:24:55.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh. There he is.Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.41,0:24:58.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa what's with that room?Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.79,0:25:01.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Who fires cannons inside other people's ships?! Seriously!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.71,0:25:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh. It's coming back.Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.75,0:25:15.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You have some nerve! Are you trying to kill me?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.93,0:25:17.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.11,0:25:19.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll show you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.19,0:25:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! He's running away!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.19,0:25:24.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Get back here!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.05,0:25:24.84,Note,,0,0,0,,"Infirmary"Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.25,0:25:30.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Does this brat have any common sense?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.99,0:25:34.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it! Foxy Face Transformation!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.43,0:25:38.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, fox!Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.57,0:25:40.31,Main,,0,0,0,,A person?Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.43,0:25:41.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Dear me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.41,0:25:43.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever's the matter? Do you feel sick?Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.15,0:25:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you sick? The head? Are you sick in the head?Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.97,0:25:50.15,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Huh?! Did anyone just come in here?Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.69,0:25:52.95,Main,,0,0,0,,No I didn't see anyone. But never mind that...Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.73,0:25:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you? Your face?Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.45,0:26:00.85,Main,,0,0,0,,That's weird... I'm sure I saw him--Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.05,0:26:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on! That woman looked like him!Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.31,0:26:10.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Could it be?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.81,0:26:13.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey you! You're that guy's sister aren't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.47,0:26:15.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Counter Fox Blow!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.17,0:26:19.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Fool!Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.23,0:26:22.47,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:30.51,Main,,0,0,0,,That's weird! He really was in this room!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.27,0:26:33.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he even trying to fight?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.49,0:26:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! The kitchen!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.73,0:26:42.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Fish fish! Cut it up sour it up! Carpaccio!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.85,0:26:45.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Grill up a sole fa-mi-re-do!Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.93,0:26:48.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Can I help you?Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.95,0:26:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a fox with its head split in two who looks like a real moron?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.33,0:26:56.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That's going too far...!Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.73,0:26:57.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It's you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.33,0:27:01.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I was the lady in the infirmary too!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.47,0:27:02.99,Main,,0,0,0,,That thing too?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.45,0:27:05.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow Beam!Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.75,0:27:07.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh... no...Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.15,0:27:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Nine-Tails Rush!Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.51,0:27:18.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think I lured you in here without a reason.Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.49,0:27:25.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Go check out what's waiting for you when you get sent flying!Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.19,0:27:27.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It ain't a living creature.Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.37,0:27:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That'd be against the rules after all.Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.75,0:27:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,While a Slow-Slow Beam is in effect any impacts given are stored up and then go off all at once.Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.19,0:27:54.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Go on now! Your life's final stop lies ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.65,0:27:57.23,Main,,0,0,0,,30 seconds are up.Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.27,0:28:14.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where is he?Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.51,0:28:18.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm... right here!Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.67,0:28:31.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Feh-feh-feh-feh-feh!Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.15,0:28:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,And another feh!Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.89,0:28:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I am Pilot Foxy! And...Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.59,0:28:42.49,Main,,0,0,0,,...let me introduce you to the Gorilla Puncher 13!Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.71,0:28:48.03,Main,,0,0,0,,A gorilla-like punching machine that's had every single flaw ironed out through constant improvement!Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Is the gorilla face really necessary?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.29,0:28:59.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Excellent point!Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.81,0:29:02.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean shut up! Who asked you?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.97,0:29:06.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Gorilla Puncher 13!Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.53,0:29:14.45,Main,,0,0,0,,How is it moving on its own?Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.15,0:29:16.55,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a secret...!Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.79,0:29:18.59,Main,,0,0,0,,You're sure sweatin' a lot...Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.87,0:29:19.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.15,0:29:27.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You think you can dodge these measly punches don'tcha?Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.23,0:29:30.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow Beam!Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.65,0:29:32.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Where are you aiming--?Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.49,0:29:34.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Take a look behind you!Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.95,0:29:37.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who's that?! A mirror?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.29,0:29:40.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! Mirrors reflect Slowmo Photons!Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.97,0:29:42.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Got ya!Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.05,0:29:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.73,0:29:55.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh that hurt? Too hot for you?Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.11,0:29:59.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I forgot to mention that this thing's punches are flaming hot!Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:02.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Better watch out! Not even Sea Kings can withstand a beating from this!Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.83,0:30:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirror Racket!Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.91,0:30:27.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We're just getting started!Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.09,0:30:33.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Slowpoke Ball Demon Coach! A two-sided attack with bouncing beams and punches!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.55,0:30:43.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Man, this is irritating! If I can just get close to him...!Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.33,0:30:50.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep running! You'll end up squished between the gorilla and the mirror!Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.85,0:30:53.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's it!Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.65,0:31:01.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I never thought of that!Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.85,0:31:05.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.25,0:31:07.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.75,0:31:14.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Got him!Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.91,0:31:21.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow Beam! Beam! Beam!Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.85,0:31:23.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Fool!Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.81,0:31:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Gorilla Punch Golden Hits!Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.21,0:31:51.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Round Three of this second Davy Back Fight, the combat round, is underway!Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.39,0:31:54.53,Main,,0,0,0,,What's happening now is anyone's guess, but there's no doubtDialogue: 0,0:31:54.59,0:31:57.45,Main,,0,0,0,,a truly epic battle is taking place inside the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.55,0:32:00.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Despite not being able to see him, the crowd cheers for our boss!Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.95,0:32:02.19,Main,,0,0,0,,He ain't gonna lose!Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.37,0:32:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course not! He's Luffy! And he has a 'fro!Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.67,0:32:07.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Being Luffy is more than enough.Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.77,0:32:09.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn fox...Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.57,0:32:12.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What's so special about an afro?Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.61,0:32:15.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Does it power you up or something?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.49,0:32:17.85,Main,,0,0,0,,This is taking longer than usual...Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.21,0:32:19.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, the guy is made of rubber.Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.91,0:32:22.19,Main,,0,0,0,,He's made of rubber and has a 'fro!Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.61,0:32:24.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's that have to do with anything?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.75,0:32:30.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my! There's activity on the deck!Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.35,0:32:35.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Who has the upper hand?! Or could the fight be over now?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.07,0:32:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I see two figures!Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.03,0:32:51.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Our boss is the one still standing!Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.45,0:32:53.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.01,0:33:01.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile Straw Hat is charred black!Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.33,0:33:04.11,Main,,0,0,0,,He seems to have taken some seriously heavy punches!Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.25,0:33:05.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.11,0:33:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That's impossible...Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.41,0:33:12.39,Main,,0,0,0,,How could some simple punches burn him?! What did he do?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.15,0:33:13.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.69,0:33:23.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is up!Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.73,0:33:27.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Just when it seemed he was down for the count he got back up!Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.23,0:33:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like you barely pulled through, Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.01,0:33:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the brotherly soul! Afro power!Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:42.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Kick his butt, Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.21,0:33:46.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.55,0:33:55.01,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the Slow-Slow Beam Sword!Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.37,0:33:59.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I've restrained your arms and legs! But feel free to move anything else!Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.27,0:34:06.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Megaton Nine-Tails Rush!Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.27,0:34:08.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Rush!Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.37,0:34:10.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Rush!Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.59,0:34:12.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Rush!Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.03,0:34:13.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Rush!Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.79,0:34:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,30 seconds.Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.03,0:34:25.95,Main,,0,0,0,,He's down for sure this time... No, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.01,0:34:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.93,0:34:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is up!Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.25,0:34:40.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Who is this guy?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.67,0:34:43.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be the 'fro! Is it the afro's wildness?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.57,0:34:48.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Stubborn little...!Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.69,0:34:49.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.61,0:34:50.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Slow-Slow Beam!Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.23,0:34:55.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Megaton Nine-Tails Rush!Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:35:02.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit, that's not fair! That beam's against the rules!Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.21,0:35:02.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.57,0:35:06.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This looks like the end...!Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.41,0:35:23.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Dealing the punches ain't so easy either!Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.43,0:35:28.19,Main,,0,0,0,,He's beating him to death out there!Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.47,0:35:33.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?! Again...?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.31,0:35:36.69,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Again...?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.49,0:35:42.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...!Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.47,0:35:49.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you have...Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.11,0:35:52.43,Main,,0,0,0,,...any of my crew mates...Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.73,0:35:55.19,Main,,0,0,0,,...even if it costs me my life!Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.03,0:36:06.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.13,0:36:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw... Straw Hat Luffy is on his feet once again!